{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y的大块保留了完整的处境、原因和转折，单看大字也更容易理解人物每一步在想什么；small：X的小字更能补出人物内心的复杂层次，例如“不是记忆变坏了，是它太好了”，Y的身体感受有些反复强调紧张和沉重。core：X在S09—S12更明确地呈现了想找回亲近、又不愿重新忍受委屈的反复拉扯，尤其“未必找得回那份亲近”和“万一能呢”保留了关键矛盾；concise：Y删掉了X中“把回去的事放一边”与“没因此想回头”等近义重复，也减少了反复出现的孤单和害怕。human：X整体表达更自然，Y有“水面看着已经平息”“急促的脚步声混着狂跳的心脏，被催着一直往前跑”等搭配或语义衔接不够自然的问题；fine：Y的身体感受更直接、具体，更容易让观众代入当下体验，而X有些感受转向了对音乐本身的描述；load：X的大字强调词较短，虽然数量不少，但整体扫读负担较轻，Y在S03、S08、S10—S12等短停留屏幕上需要阅读多条较长的大块。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "81b6728a-aaae-4c95-bbb9-2c1ce8774482", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T194515217062Z", "elapsed_seconds": 304.969, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T19:50:20.199972+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1f3a1a2f958639d05317f1d14c44ea23fb0cf6ab8db3ec8ce62518bcc5d18bac", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py